 4. 🍧 1 food thing: Reuben... ice cream? 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 The Katz's Reuben at Kith. Photo: Carrie Shepherd/Axios New York's legendary Katz's Delicatessen has landed in Chicago — but don't expect pastrami sandwiches, Axios Chicago's Carrie Shepherd reports. 

 🍦 Clothing store and ice cream cafe Kith teamed up with Katz's for three limited-time treats.

 The Latke, The Egg Cream Deluxe and The Reuben are on the menu until Oct. 10. The Reuben features vanilla ice cream mixed with Cheez-Its, rye croutons, and beetroot powder.

 It's topped with black sanding sugar, a dehydrated Swiss cheese chip, Maldon salt and a Katz's pickle. Dig in ... Get Axios Local . 

 
 
